DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
17120::$$$message_0129_0000_0000$$$::On the way across the pedestrian bridge, I see a sight that catches my attention.[lr]::
17121::$$$message_0129_0000_0001$$$::"Wait, Saegusa from Tohsaka's class...?"[lr]::
17122::$$$message_0129_0000_0002$$$::The back of that bouncing girl is Saegusa.[lr]::
17123::$$$message_0129_0000_0003$$$::It's not like we made eye contact, so the normal thing to do would be to just mind my own business...::
17124::$$$message_0129_0001_0000$$$::"I'm surprised. You're from Homurahara, Yukika? I thought you were younger."[lr]::
17125::$$$message_0129_0001_0001$$$::"Yeah, I am. Sorry, Gil. I'm actually a lot older than you."[lr]::
17126::$$$message_0129_0001_0002$$$::"Oh... No, I should be the one apologizing. That was a slip of the tongue. I'm a disgrace as a man to ask a woman her age."::
17127::$$$message_0129_0002_0000$$$::"Oh, but I'm a bit happy. I prefer you to be like a big sister rather than a friend."::
17128::$$$message_0129_0003_0000$$$::"Hehe, thanks. I also wish I had a calm little brother like you, Gil. My little brothers are all rambunctious."[lr]::
17129::$$$message_0129_0003_0001$$$::"Haha, Kota and the others are definitely too energetic.[lr]::
17130::$$$message_0129_0003_0002$$$::They're always running around without a fear every day. You have it hard, Yukika."::
17131::$$$message_0129_0004_0000$$$::"Yeah. Gil, can you stop my little brothers if they're about to do something reckless?[lr]::
17132::$$$message_0129_0004_0001$$$::They won't listen even if I say anything, but they listen to whatever you say, right? They respect you, Gil."::
17133::$$$message_0129_0005_0000$$$::"That's not it. They listen to what you say, Yukika.[lr]::
17134::$$$message_0129_0005_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=由紀香私服02c(中)] There's nothing to worry about even if I'm not here. Kota and the others won't do anything that will make you sad after all."::
17135::$$$message_0129_0006_0000$$$::"...Well, the problem is that they're trying to trouble you. Even I can't discourage them from doing that."::
17136::$$$message_0129_0007_0000$$$::"...They seem to be friendly with each other... What is he doing with Saegusa...?"[lr]::
17137::$$$message_0129_0007_0001$$$::I watch them while hiding behind a bench.[lr]::
17138::$$$message_0129_0007_0002$$$::That golden child is unmistakably Gilgamesh.[lr]::
17139::$$$message_0129_0007_0003$$$::He's now a charismatic figure among the kids of Miyama, referred to as "Godfather of the kid mafia."::
17140::$$$message_0129_0008_0000$$$::"By the way, Yukika, you don't have track practice today, right? Are you free for the afternoon?"[lr]::
17141::$$$message_0129_0008_0001$$$::"Yeah, I'm free. I finished my laundry in the morning, so I was gonna take it easy until dinner."::
17142::$$$message_0129_0009_0000$$$::"I see, so you came to the park for a walk.[lr]::
17143::$$$message_0129_0009_0001$$$::I'm glad. I just happened to get fed up with my guardian and came to the park, but it seems like my luck has changed."[lr]::
17144::$$$message_0129_0009_0002$$$::"Huh? Um... Your mother is, uh..."::
17145::$$$message_0129_0010_0000$$$::"Oh, did you hear from Kota and the others?[cacheimage storage=ギル子供01d(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=ギル子供01d(中)] ...Umm, she's not my mother, but she's my guardian. She's a difficult person and gets mad over small things. She's the polar opposite from you.[lr]::
17146::$$$message_0129_0010_0001$$$::No, it would be rude to you to even compare you to her. She's just a housewife, and you're the person I like.[lr]::
17147::$$$message_0129_0010_0002$$$::If I was going to need a guardian, I wish it could have been you, as my Master."::
17148::$$$message_0129_0011_0000$$$::"Huh... 'Master'...? [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服02i(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=由紀香私服02i(中)]No, more importantly, um..."[lr]::
17149::$$$message_0129_0011_0001$$$::"Yeah, the person I like. [wvl][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(401,85,255)(416,78,255)(434,82,255) storage=由紀香私服02i(中) accel=0]I said that I prefer a big sister over friends, didn't I?[lr]::
17150::$$$message_0129_0011_0002$$$::What about you, Yukika? Have you been with someone younger before?"[lr]::
17151::$$$message_0129_0011_0003$$$::"U-Um, Gil, what...!?"::
17152::$$$message_0129_0012_0000$$$::"That bastard...! He's finally showing his true colors...!"[lr]::
17153::$$$message_0129_0012_0001$$$::That goody two shoes act was a mask after all![lr]::
17154::$$$message_0129_0012_0002$$$::At this rate, Saegusa will get eaten right up...!::
17155::$$$message_0129_0013_0000$$$::"Stop right thereeee! What are you trying to pull in this peaceful park, you erotomaniac!"[lr]::
17156::$$$message_0129_0013_0001$$$::"E-Emiya!?"[lr]::
17157::$$$message_0129_0013_0002$$$::"Oh, Mister."[lr]::
17158::$$$message_0129_0013_0003$$$::Saegusa jumps away from the blond boy.[lr]::
17159::$$$message_0129_0013_0004$$$::On the other hand, kid Gil is looking over here unhappily.::
17160::$$$message_0129_0014_0000$$$::"G-Goodbye, Emiya! [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01i(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=由紀香私服01i(中)]I just remembered I have something to do... [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01g頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=由紀香私服01g頬(中)]Hello...!"[lr]::
17161::$$$message_0129_0014_0001$$$::The wild rabbit escapes.[lr]::
17162::$$$message_0129_0014_0002$$$::I regret what I did after seeing how much she panicked.::
17163::$$$message_0129_0015_0000$$$::"...Geez, who are you calling an erotomaniac? You're the last person I want to hear that from."[lr]::
17164::$$$message_0129_0015_0001$$$::"It's the truth, right? Why are you hitting on Saegusa?[lr]::
17165::$$$message_0129_0015_0002$$$::I don't know what kind of game you're playing, but there are people you can tease and people you can't tease."::
17166::$$$message_0129_0016_0000$$$::"Hey, you're the one being rude. I seriously like Yukika."[lr]::
17167::$$$message_0129_0016_0001$$$::"Yeah right! ...Wait, I mean, it is rude to doubt you about these kind of things.[lr]::
17168::$$$message_0129_0016_0002$$$::Oh... Um, like actually?"::
17169::$$$message_0129_0017_0000$$$::"I am not lying. A woman like Yukika is ideal as a life partner."[lr]::
17170::$$$message_0129_0017_0001$$$::...Guh.[lr]::
17171::$$$message_0129_0017_0002$$$::Hearing an embarrassing line being declared without any shame makes me embarrassed for doubting him.::
17172::$$$message_0129_0018_0000$$$::"S-Sorry for assuming you were just playing games.[lr]::
17173::$$$message_0129_0018_0001$$$::...But, what's gotten into you?[lr]::
17174::$$$message_0129_0018_0002$$$::Didn't you like Saber?"[lr]::
17175::$$$message_0129_0018_0003$$$::"Saber is like the sun. I'm not that interested.[lr]::
17176::$$$message_0129_0018_0004$$$::She must be useful as a vassal, but she's not fit to be a partner that I spend the rest of my life with."::
17177::$$$message_0129_0019_0000$$$::"...You say some terrifying things.[lr]::
17178::$$$message_0129_0019_0001$$$::So basically, are you trying to say that you like how Saegusa is domestic or like how she's supportive?"::
17179::$$$message_0129_0020_0000$$$::"Ahaha, that is a misunderstanding, Mister. It's not that Yukika is supportive, but she's someone that needs to be protected.[lr]::
17180::$$$message_0129_0020_0001$$$::Wildflowers are more important to me than roses. How much you can protect simple flowers to keep them simple... That is what I think a man's supportiveness is."::
17181::$$$message_0129_0021_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
17182::$$$message_0129_0021_0001$$$::I'm speechless.[lr]::
17183::$$$message_0129_0021_0002$$$::In short, this kid is saying that Saegusa has nothing special, but that's something really good.[lr]::
17184::$$$message_0129_0021_0003$$$::...W-What should I do? I might actually really end up liking this guy...::
17185::$$$message_0129_0022_0000$$$::"In other words, instead of controlling the person you like, your way of expressing love is by nurturing and protecting them?"::
17186::$$$message_0129_0023_0000$$$::"Control will only work on those who want to be controlled. People seem to forget that as they get older. If I had the choice, I would have wanted to be a good leader.[lr]::
17187::$$$message_0129_0023_0001$$$::...Seriously, why did I do things that would only scare everyone."::
17188::$$$message_0129_0024_0000$$$::Wow...[lr]::
17189::$$$message_0129_0024_0001$$$::For the sake of the world, this king should stay as a child. For sure. Without a doubt.::
17190::$$$message_0129_0025_0000$$$::"Oh. But, what would you do if they don't turn out to be your type after all that?[lr]::
17191::$$$message_0129_0025_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=ギル子供01a(中)]Looking after them means you won't force anything on them, right?[lr]::
17192::$$$message_0129_0025_0002$$$::What are you going to do if they turn out like the Master you don't like after looking after them?"::
17193::$$$message_0129_0026_0000$$$::"I would just discard them then. It just wasn't meant to be."[lr]::
17194::$$$message_0129_0026_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
17195::$$$message_0129_0026_0002$$$::I take back what I said. He's the same guy after all.[lr]::
17196::$$$message_0129_0026_0003$$$::He has a ruthless core that nobody can change.::
17197::$$$message_0129_0027_0000$$$::"...Ahh. So if Saegusa turned out like Tohsaka, then you would fall out of love?"::
17198::$$$message_0129_0028_0000$$$::"I wouldn't fall out of love. It's just that my love for them wouldn't increase any further. It would become something that won't change for eternity. It wouldn't increase, and it wouldn't die.[lr]::
17199::$$$message_0129_0028_0001$$$::Love once gained won't fade. It's not true that you love someone so much you start to hate them.[lr]::
17200::$$$message_0129_0028_0002$$$::That is just when newfound hate surpasses the love built up until then."::
17201::$$$message_0129_0029_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
17202::$$$message_0129_0029_0001$$$::For example.[lr]::
17203::$$$message_0129_0029_0002$$$::The boy that believes in both the good parts and bad parts of humans.[lr]::
17204::$$$message_0129_0029_0003$$$::Just like how he learns so much hate that would make that love worthless.::
17205::$$$message_0129_0030_0000$$$::"Well, there are cases like that.[lr]::
17206::$$$message_0129_0030_0001$$$::No matter how much a man goes against humanity, unfortunately, his love lives on. This makes him look human and as a result he is hated as a human.[lr]::
17207::$$$message_0129_0030_0002$$$::Yes. If he was completely inhuman, then he would've been distinguished as a god."::
17208::$$$message_0129_0031_0000$$$::The golden kid bids farewell and turns on his heel.[lr]::
17209::$$$message_0129_0031_0001$$$::He isn't heading to the direction that Saegusa ran off to, but to the bridge that heads toward Shinto.::
17210::$$$message_0129_0032_0000$$$::"Hey. Aren't you gonna go after Saegusa?"[lr]::
17211::$$$message_0129_0032_0001$$$::"It's fine, I've accomplished what I set out to do. Yukika cares for her brothers, so she may be out late looking for them.[lr]::
17212::$$$message_0129_0032_0002$$$::It's dangerous, right? Today is the fourth day, the bridge at night is the most dangerous, so the worst case can happen."::
17213::$$$message_0129_0033_0000$$$::"But, Yukika went home thanks to you, and she won't return here until tomorrow at the very least.[lr]::
17214::$$$message_0129_0033_0001$$$::It's not ideal, but it's an acceptable result."::
17215::$$$message_0129_0034_0000$$$::The King of Heroes declares with a flawless smile and leaves this time.[lr]::
17216::$$$message_0129_0034_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
17217::$$$message_0129_0034_0002$$$::...I feel unnecessarily sentimental.[lr]::
17218::$$$message_0129_0034_0003$$$::He seems to be dealing with his abnormality in his own way.[lr]::
17219::$$$message_0129_0034_0004$$$::Maybe he's actually discovering the value in this everyday life as much as I am.>B